                "urpx:name": "Discountable subtotal for D. The 11 bill components the CARE and FERA percentage discounts both apply to. Schedule D-CARE Sheet 1 applies the discount before the PUCRF, user fees, taxes and late payment charges, so the PUCRF is excluded, and the California Climate Credit is excluded because Special Condition 12 applies it after those taxes. Both programs discount the same components and differ only in rate, so one subtotal serves both.",
